# Zibang (2026-10-07): "This sync will purge 7,897 charts, 180.5 GB from drives
# and setlists you've disabled", Rock Band charts in it, nothing switched off.
# Suspected cause: a custom drive that is a shipped setlist (added before it
# shipped, or a shortcut to it), with the shipped copy on too. 1.5.6 kept one
# setlist per folder id, so one copy read as off and its charts as a purge.
setup
on "CSC Released Packs/A Bonus Gift Pack"
on "BirdmanExe Drive/BirdmanExe"
custom "CSC Released Packs/A Bonus Gift Pack"
launch
wait "Google Drive checked" 300
press S
wait "Finished in" 900
wait "Google Drive checked" 120
relaunch
wait "Google Drive checked" 300
press S
wait "Finished in" 900
wait "Google Drive checked" 120
shot after
refute "S sync ["
settled
exists "A Bonus Gift Pack/*"
quit
